        "text": "(hg : Integrable g) (hhg : MemLp (fun x => h x * g x) (6/5)) (ψ ψh : ComplexTest) : pressurePair i j g ψh = (∫ x, (h x * g x : ℝ) * rieszTest i j ψ x) + commutatorPair i j h g ψ ψh  -- arbitrary multiplier h"
